it  expect from Pixar the animation is  top-notch with an array of gorgeous  scene setting familiar and new ocean  locations from the coral reef to kelp  forests and lots of interesting land  bone the cows provided by an aquatic  rehabilitation center on the California  coast there is a feeling about finding  Dory that were retreading some of the  same water we covered in Finding Nemo  both thematically and in terms of some  of the ocean set scenes in particular  and it's not as nuanced as Pixar's best  but there's still lots of fun to be had  with some great characters humorous  moments and action filled sequences that  make the movie worth watching as well as  an underlying message which emphasizes  the ability in disability which deserves  to be heard and while Pixar's last  feature the good dinosaur had more  grown-up human than I first expected in  a movie that was more squarely pitched  at kids than say inside out finding dory  doesn't quite hit the creatively clever  heights that we've come to expect of  Pixar when it comes to adult laughs  there you'll still find a decent number  of them by the way if you're an Easter  Egg hunter don't forget to keep your  eyes peeled throughout and I'll have my  video guide to the movies Easter eggs  right here when it's ready oh and if you  usually - right out of the cinema as  soon as a film prop is finished just be  aware there are some lovely animated  moments during the credits and at the  very end of the credits there's a little  treat too so make sure you don't miss  that so to sum up finding Dory isn't  quite unforgettable but it is  beautifully animated and full of warmth  and it features a nice mix of colorful  characters and a voice cast who really  deliver the goods while it's not a  hundred percent fresh catch of the day  overall it's a plenty enjoyable and  entertaining film and on top of that the  short film Piper which screens before us  it's a lovely little delight finding  Dory gets 4 out of 5 flicks now what did  you think of finding Dory and what's  your favorite Pixar movie and why let me  know in the comments below if you liked  this review I'd love it if you'd share  it and do subscribe for more movie  reviews Easter egg videos and amazing  movie facts click the links here to  check those out thanks for watching and  see you next time yippee-ki-yay movie  lovers
 

